{"productId": "cca44d29-d163-4415-84e7-d5699c693bcd", "modelName": "Big Boy Eagle Scout Centennial Tribute", "modelDescription": "As a testament to the extraordinary accomplishments of Scouting\u2019s highest achievers, and in reverence to a legacy spanning more than a century, Henry Repeating Arms is proud to offer this Centennial Tribute Edition rifle honoring America\u2019s Eagle Scouts. Built on the world-renowned Big Boy platform, this special edition commemorates both the Eagle Scout rank and its enduring impact through Scouting America. At the heart of the rifle is its iconic hardened brass receiver, where the Eagle Scout Award Medal is engraved on the right side and selectively nickel plated for striking contrast. An American-style scroll pattern surrounds the medal and continues forward past the side loading gate. Adjacent to the medal, a scrolling banner reads Scouting America. The left side of the receiver is adorned with a highly detailed portrait of a majestic bald eagle, also selectively plated in nickel. Intertwined with the scrollwork is a banner bearing the pledge, \u201cTo This I Pledge My Sacred Honor,\u201d the closing line recited at every Eagle Court of Honor and a powerful reminder of both achievement earned and responsibility accepted.", "manufacturerName": "Henry Repeating Arms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "f5c9e753-aae8-4809-be51-cbd9fca78f59", "description": "Henry Repeating Arms, Big Boy Eagle Scout Centennial Tribute 2nd Edition, Lever Action, 44 Magnum, 20\" Octagon Barrel, Brass Receiver, Engraved Receiver/Stock/Forearm, Semi Buckhorn Sights, American Walnut Stock, 10 Rounds", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/4cfb15f5-dc02-4e25-a3d1-870507dc2888", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3d47ea44-33da-487d-8712-51ecf0e3b0f6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/7cdcd844-a8f3-49e0-81a2-9dbbc186299a", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubPro